# Fredrin's per-ticket tooling. The `fredrin` wrapper carries a scoped API
# credential and the hooks and context pack are regenerated for every worktree,
# so none of it belongs in the repo. `setup.sh` is the exception: it is the
# bootstrap script the project commits deliberately (see PR #1).
#
# FREDRIN.md is ignored because this repo has never tracked it. If the project
# later decides to commit it, add `!.fredrin/FREDRIN.md` below.
.fredrin/*
!.fredrin/setup.sh

# macOS / editor noise
.DS_Store
